subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Track LLM API usage costs

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [usage] <OPTIONS>         Track LLM API usage costs
  add <OPTIONS>             Add an LLM API usage entry
  delete <OPTIONS>          Delete LLM API usage entries
  edit <OPTIONS>            Update fields of an LLM API usage entry
  import <OPTIONS>          Import LLM API usage from JSONL/JSON response log files
  list <OPTIONS>            List LLM API usage entries
  refresh <OPTIONS>         Auto-scan known sources (OpenCode DB, Claude Code, Codex CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf) and import usage data — defaults to current month
  total <OPTIONS>           Show aggregated LLM API usage costs for a period

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack usage --help
  subtrack usage add --help
  subtrack usage delete --help
  subtrack usage edit --help
  subtrack usage import --help
  subtrack usage list --help
  subtrack usage refresh --help
  subtrack usage total --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

